### Color Testing and Validation

**Always test your colors:**

1. **Visit `/color-palette`** to see all available colors
2. **Test theme switching** - ensure colors work in both light and dark themes
3. **Check contrast** - ensure text is readable on colored backgrounds
4. **Validate accessibility** - use proper color combinations for WCAG compliance

